Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 14:54:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Shift light, pro-style: shift RPM per gear, lamp output
 and LED bar data

Requested by Carlos (next firmware round, 01/11).
- new module ShiftLight: shift RPM for gear unknown / neutral plus gears
  1 to 6 (a gear left at 0 uses the first value); turns on at the shift RPM
  and off 100 RPM below it
- lamp output shiftLightPin (steady or blinking 1-20 Hz)
- LED bar: fills from shift RPM - shiftLightPreRpm up to the shift RPM
- live data for the app (flash the screen, draw the LED bar): Shift light
  RPM (this gear), Shift light bar %, Shift light on
- all 0 = off (default)
- TunerStudio: Advanced > Shift light
- 4 new tests

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012qcg6EYkigZc99xZ8xdABd
